---
---
<section class="testimoni-section" id="testimoni">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.css" />
  
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header fade-up">
      <span class="subtitle">Testimoni Sahabat</span>
      <h2>Apa Kata <span class="text-gradient">Mereka?</span></h2>
      <p class="description">Pengalaman nyata dari mereka yang telah bertumbuh dan belajar bersama Tahseena.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ts-slider-wrapper">
      <div class="swiper ts-swiper-final">
        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
          <!-- Slide 1 -->
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <p class="testi-text">"Metode pembelajaran di Tahseena sangat interaktif. Saya yang tadinya terbata-bata, sekarang jauh lebih lancar membaca Al-Qur'an dengan tajwid yang benar."</p>
              <div class="user-info">
                <img src="/img/testimonials/user1.png" alt="Ahmad" class="user-img" loading="lazy" />
                <div class="user-meta">
                  <h4>Ahmad Fauzi</h4>
                  <span>Karyawan Swasta</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 2 -->
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <p class="testi-text">"Tahseena Kids beneran ngebantu anak saya jadi semangat ngaji. Interface-nya keren dan ustadzah-nya sabar banget ngajarin anak sampai bisa."</p>
              <div class="user-info">
                <img src="/img/testimonials/user2.png" alt="Siti" class="user-img" loading="lazy" />
                <div class="user-meta">
                  <h4>Siti Aminah</h4>
                  <span>Ibu Rumah Tangga</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Slide 3 -->
          <div class="swiper-slide">
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
              <p class="testi-text">"Waktu fleksibel sangat membantu saya yang sibuk. Kualitas pengajarannya tetap premium dan sangat profesional bagi kami para pekerja."</p>
              <div class="user-info">
                <img src="/img/testimonials/user3.png" alt="Budi" class="user-img" loading="lazy" />
                <div class="user-meta">
                  <h4>Budi Santoso</h4>
                  <span>Manager IT</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Pagination -->
        <div class="swiper-pagination ts-pag"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <button class="ts-nav-btn ts-go-prev" aria-label="Previous slide">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="ts-nav-btn ts-go-next" aria-label="Next slide">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    (function() {
      function init() {
        if (typeof Swiper !== 'undefined') {
          new Swiper(".ts-swiper-final", {
            slidesPerView: 1,
            spaceBetween: 30,
            centeredSlides: true,
            loop: true,
            autoplay: { delay: 5000, disableOnInteraction: false },
            pagination: { el: ".ts-pag", clickable: true },
            navigation: { nextEl: ".ts-go-next", prevEl: ".ts-go-prev" },
          });
        } else { setTimeout(init, 200); }
      }
      setTimeout(init, 500);
    })();
  </script>
</section>

<style>
  .testimoni-section {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: transparent;
    transition: background 0.3s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px auto;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .text-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--primary-cyan));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .description {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ts-slider-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 800px; /* Focused width to prevent text stretching */
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ts-swiper-final {
    padding-bottom: 60px; /* Prevent dots from overlapping card */
  }

  .testi-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 50px 40px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
  }

  .swiper-slide {
    height: auto; /* Allow consistent height scaling */
  }

  .stars {
    color: #f59e0b;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .testi-text {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 auto 35px auto;
    max-width: 600px; /* Keep text contained and readable */
    flex-grow: 1;
    font-size: 1.25rem; /* Slightly reduced for elegance */
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .user-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }

  .user-img {
    width: 75px;
    height: 75px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 4px solid var(--card-bg);
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .user-meta h4 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .user-meta span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* Navigation UI */
  .ts-nav-btn {
    position: absolute;
    top: 45%;
    width: 55px;
    height: 55px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 10;
    transition: 0.3s;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .ts-nav-btn:hover {
    background: var(--primary-blue);
    color: white;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ts-go-prev { left: -70px; }
  .ts-go-next { right: -70px; }

  /* Swiper Pagination */
  :global(.ts-pag) {
    bottom: 0px !important;
  }

  :global(.ts-pag .swiper-pagination-bullet) {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background: var(--text-light) !important;
    opacity: 0.3 !important;
  }

  :global(.ts-pag .swiper-pagination-bullet-active) {
    width: 30px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--primary-blue) !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .ts-go-prev { left: -20px; }
    .ts-go-next { right: -20px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .testimoni-section { padding: 80px 0; }
    h2 { font-size: 2.4rem; }
    .ts-nav-btn { display: none; }
    .testi-card { padding: 40px 25px; min-height: auto; border-radius: 30px; }
    .testi-text { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  }
</style>
